@startuml 02-target-state
title Target State - One Standard Path for Jobs and Apps

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #EDF7ED
  BorderColor #4C8C4A
}
skinparam cloud {
  BackgroundColor #EEF3FA
  BorderColor #6B8CB8
}

actor "Any Platform User" as U
actor "Platform Admin" as PA

rectangle "Template repo\n(DABs bundle + CI workflow)" as TPL
rectangle "Git (PR + review)" as GIT
rectangle "CI Pipeline\nvalidate -> deploy\n(tool per ADR: GH Actions /\nJenkins-CloudBees / ADO)" as CI
rectangle "Service Principals\n(per environment)" as SP

cloud "Databricks" {
  rectangle "dev target" as DEV
  rectangle "staging target" as STG
  rectangle "prod target" as PROD #DCEDC8
}

U --> TPL : clone
TPL --> GIT : commit
GIT --> CI : PR merged / tag cut
CI --> SP : authenticates as
SP --> DEV : on merge
SP --> STG : on release branch
SP --> PROD : on tag + approval gate

PA .[#2E7D32].> GIT : full audit trail
PA .[#2E7D32].> PROD : knows exactly what runs where

note bottom of CI #F1F8E9
  **What the epic delivers**
  * ADR: settled decisions (story 1)
  * Job + App templates (stories 2, 4)
  * SOPs users can follow unaided (stories 3, 5)
  * Proven by external-team pilot (story 6)
end note
@enduml
